  "body": "## What happens\n\n- `assets/posts/heidenhain-klartext.cps:129` accepts tool numbers up to 32767.\n- `assets/posts/heidenhain.cps:334-338` has no limit.\n\n## What the control allows\n\nThe Fehlmann Picomax 55 (iTNC 530, NC 340490-03) has **MP 7260 = 254** tool-table lines (the machine parameter file from the delivery CD). The machine's programming manual also says tool numbers 0..254 (p. 2-16).\n\nA program with a tool number above 254 passes CamCraft and stops with an alarm at the control.\n\n## Expected\n\n- The machine file states the tool-table size (a new field, for example `toolNumberMax`), and both Heidenhain posts refuse a higher tool number by name.\n- Machines without the field keep today's behaviour.\n\n## Done means\n\n- A job with tool 255 on the Picomax machine is refused by name by both posts.\n- Tool 254 posts. Tests pin both. The existing goldens do not change.",
